  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1302.23 Grant agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1302.23 “Grant agreement” means the financial assistance agreement between the state and a recipient through which the state agrees to provide grant funds approved by the commission from the DWGTF to the recipient and the recipient agrees to use the grant funds as specified in its application as approved by the commission.\n\nSource. #12903, eff 10-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1300.html"
